ssential ‌amenities, ‌this turnkey home delivers ‌design, ‌comfort, ‌and ‌lifestyle ‌in ‌equal ‌measure."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Suroeste","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Suelo Radiante","Baño","Mar","Montaña","Panorámicas","Jardín","Urbanas","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Opcionales","Privado","Recinto Cerrado","Alarma","Comunitario","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South West","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","U/F Heating","U/F/H Bathrooms","Sea","Mountain","Panoramic","Garden","Urban","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Barbeque","Double Glazing","Optional","Private","Gated Complex","Alarm System","Communal","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}